#: ../../source/agentic.rst:2
msgid "Agentic Quantum Research"
msgstr "智能体量子研究"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:5
msgid ""
"TensorCircuit-NG is an AI-native quantum research runtime for agentic "
"discovery, algorithm design, quantum simulation, execution optimization, "
"validation, and research artifact generation."
msgstr "TensorCircuit-NG 是一个 AI 原生的量子研究运行时，面向智能体驱动的发现、算法设计、量子模拟、执行优化、验证和研究产物生成。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:7
msgid ""
"From published quantum knowledge to executable research infrastructure, "
"TensorCircuit-NG connects AI agents to the context, rules, skills, and "
"high-performance execution backends required for serious quantum "
"research."
msgstr ""
"从已发表的量子知识到可执行的研究基础设施，TensorCircuit-NG 将 AI "
"智能体与严肃量子研究所需要的上下文、规则、技能和高性能执行后端连接起来。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:12
msgid "🚀 Experience Agent-Native Discovery"
msgstr "🚀 体验智能体原生发现"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:19
msgid ""
"Explore how AI agents can discover, implement, optimize, validate, and "
"communicate quantum research workflows in TensorCircuit-NG."
msgstr "了解 AI 智能体如何在 TensorCircuit-NG 中发现、实现、优化、验证和交流量子研究工作流。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:21
msgid "Platform Overview"
msgstr "平台概述"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:27
msgid ""
"Review the broader TensorCircuit-NG architecture, performance evidence, "
"and adoption landscape."
msgstr "了解更广泛的 TensorCircuit-NG 架构、性能数据以及应用生态。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:32
msgid "Agentic evaluation"
msgstr "智能体评测"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:34
msgid ""
"The `ORBIT-Q benchmark <https://sxzgroup.github.io/ORBIT-Q/>`_ is the "
"evaluation layer for agentic quantum software: it tests autonomous agents"
" on framework-constrained scientific programming, correctness, and "
"artifact efficiency. It makes agent-friendliness measurable rather than "
"treating it as a code-generation slogan, while also evaluating the "
"runtime performance of the resulting scientific artifacts."
msgstr ""
"`ORBIT-Q 基准 <https://sxzgroup.github.io/ORBIT-Q/>`_ "
"是智能体量子软件评测层：它在框架约束下的科学编程、正确性和产物效率方面测试自主智能体。它使“智能体友好”变得可度量，而不是停留为一句代码生成口号，同时也评估所生成科研产物的运行时性能。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:36
msgid ""
"In the reported framework-axis comparison, TensorCircuit-NG achieved the "
"highest agent solve success rate and the lowest artifact-runtime slowdown"
" among the evaluated quantum software frameworks. Together, the agentic "
"skills and ORBIT-Q evaluation establish a measurable loop for building, "
"testing, and improving AI-agent-compatible quantum software. See the "
"`accompanying paper <https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.03105>`_ for the "
"benchmark design and methodology."
msgstr ""
"在已报道的框架维度对比中，TensorCircuit-NG "
"在被评估的量子软件框架中取得了最高的智能体求解成功率，以及最低的产物运行时性能损失。智能体技能与 ORBIT-Q "
"评测共同构成了一个可度量的闭环，用于构建、测试和改进与 AI 智能体兼容的量子软件。基准设计与方法见 `随附论文 "
"<https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.03105>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:40
msgid "Why Work Within the Repository?"
msgstr "为什么要在仓库内工作？"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:42
msgid ""
"To write scripts and applications efficiently with AI coding agents "
"(e.g., ClaudeCode, Cursor, Codex, Antigravity, OpenCode), we strongly "
"recommend working directly within the local repository."
msgstr ""
"为了高效地使用 AI 编程智能体（如 "
"ClaudeCode、Cursor、Codex、Antigravity、OpenCode）编写脚本和应用程序，我们强烈建议直接在本地仓库内工作。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:45
msgid ""
"**Rich Context**: The repository contains over 100 scripts in "
"``examples/`` and extensive test cases in ``tests/``. These provide "
"essential references that significantly reduce AI hallucinations and help"
" the agent understand idiomatic usage."
msgstr ""
"**丰富的上下文**: 仓库中的 ``examples/`` 目录下包含 100 多个脚本，``tests/`` 目录下有大量的测试用例。这些为 "
"AI 提供了必不可少的参考，显著减少了 AI 幻觉，并帮助智能体理解地道的用法。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:46
msgid ""
"**Built-in Rules**: We provide a dedicated `AGENTS.md "
"<https://github.com/tensorcircuit/tensorcircuit-"
"ng/blob/master/AGENTS.md>`_ file. It serves as the \"handbook\" (similar "
"to ``CLAUDE.md``) for AI agents, defining coding standards and best "
"practices."
msgstr ""
"**内置规则**: 我们提供了一个专门的 `AGENTS.md <https://github.com/tensorcircuit"
"/tensorcircuit-ng/blob/master/AGENTS.md>`_ 文件。它是 AI 智能体的“手册”（类似于 "
"``CLAUDE.md``），定义了编码标准和最佳实践。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:47
msgid ""
"**Specialized Agentic Skills**: The ``.agents/skills/`` directory "
"contains specialized workflows to guide AI assistants on complex, multi-"
"step tasks."
msgstr "**专业智能体技能**: ``.agents/skills/`` 目录包含了专门的工作流，用于引导 AI 助手完成复杂的多步任务。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:50
msgid "Specialized Agentic Skills"
msgstr "专业智能体技能"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:52
msgid ""
"TensorCircuit-NG includes built-in agentic skills that can be activated "
"by compatible AI agents to perform advanced tasks:"
msgstr "TensorCircuit-NG 包含了内置的智能体技能，可由兼容的 AI 智能体激活以执行高级任务："

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:54
msgid ""
"**arxiv-reproduce**: Translates published methods into standardized, "
"runnable, and validated research artifacts."
msgstr "**arxiv-reproduce**: 将已发表的方法转化为标准化、可运行且经过验证的研究产物。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:55
msgid ""
"**performance-optimize**: Scientific execution and memory optimization "
"workflow (JAX scanning, vectorized parallelism, etc.)."
msgstr "**performance-optimize**: 科学执行与内存优化工作流（JAX scanning、向量化并行等）。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:56
msgid ""
"**tc-rosetta**: End-to-end framework translation (from Qiskit, PennyLane,"
" etc.) with intrinsic mathematical intent rewriting."
msgstr "**tc-rosetta**: 端到端框架转换（从 Qiskit、PennyLane 等转换），具有内在数学意图重写功能。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:57
msgid ""
"**tutorial-crafter**: Transforms raw scripts into comprehensive, "
"narrative-driven educational tutorials."
msgstr "**tutorial-crafter**: 将原始脚本转换为全面的、叙事驱动的教学教程。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:58
msgid ""
"**demo-generator**: Transforms scripts into interactive, high-performance"
" Streamlit GUI applications."
msgstr "**demo-generator**: 将脚本转换为交互式、高性能的 Streamlit GUI 应用程序。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:59
msgid ""
"**code-reviewer**: Autonomously reviews and refactors code for "
"mathematical correctness and performance."
msgstr "**code-reviewer**: 自主审查和重构代码，以确保数学正确性和性能。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:60
msgid ""
"**sanity-checker**: Systematic audit and refactoring to reduce technical "
"debt, improve abstractions, and ensure codebase health."
msgstr "**sanity-checker**：系统性审计 and 重构，以减少技术债务、改善抽象并确保代码库的健康。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:61
msgid ""
"**meta-explorer**: High-intensity autonomous research agent for circuit "
"architecture and optimization strategy discovery (VQE, QML, QAOA, etc.)."
msgstr "**meta-explorer**: 高强度的自主研究智能体，用于线路架构和优化策略发现（VQE、QML、QAOA 等）。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:64
msgid "Recommended Workflow"
msgstr "推荐工作流"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:66
msgid "**Clone the repository**:"
msgstr "**克隆仓库**:"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:72
msgid "**Switch to a local playground branch**:"
msgstr "**切换到本地测试（playground）分支**:"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:78
msgid ""
"**Open the repository folder in your AI IDE**: Start writing TC-NG-based "
"scripts using natural language instructions."
msgstr "**在 AI IDE 中打开仓库文件夹**: 开始使用自然语言指令编写基于 TensorCircuit-NG 的脚本。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:80
msgid ""
"By integrating extreme performance with an autonomous, intent-driven AI "
"workflow, TensorCircuit-NG helps researchers move from a research "
"question to implementation, exploration, optimization, validation, and a "
"reusable scientific artifact."
msgstr ""
"通过将极致性能与自主的、意图驱动的 AI 工作流相结合，TensorCircuit-NG "
"帮助研究人员从研究问题走向实现、探索、优化、验证以及可复用的科学产物。"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:83
msgid "Initial Prompt for Empty Workspace Setup"
msgstr "空白工作区初始设置提示词"

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:85
msgid ""
"When starting in a completely empty folder/workspace with an AI agent, "
"you can copy and paste the following initial prompt to bootstrap the "
"agent. This instructs the agent to clone the repository, read coding "
"guidelines/skills, and execute tasks accordingly:"
msgstr ""
"当在完全空白的文件夹/工作区中使用 AI "
"智能体时，您可以复制并粘贴以下初始提示词以引导该智能体。这将指示智能体克隆仓库、阅读编码规范与技能文件，并相应地执行任务："

#: ../../source/agentic.rst:103
msgid "AI-Native Documentation"
msgstr "AI 原生文档"

